notes = "High lilac-heather grassland west of the court ending at an escarpment that looks south-west to the Summer Court's coast (no sea cliffs in Spring; Keeper). Watchtowers of Tamlin's sentries. The fells foot holds the Silent Hollow and the Old Shrines (pre-Treaty ruins)."
